# Local-only working notes for Claude Code -- deliberately not committed. It exists to remind a
# session working in this repo not to leak Planning/ references (DAY-N build notes, spec section
# numbers) into shipped code or docs; committing the file itself would defeat that by putting
# those exact references in the (public) repo. Claude Code reads CLAUDE.md straight off disk at
# session start regardless of git-tracking status, so gitignoring it still keeps it loaded into
# context -- it just never reaches GitHub.
CLAUDE.md

# Planning docs live OUTSIDE this repo, in ../Planning/ (a sibling of src/), for the same
# reason CLAUDE.md is ignored above: DAY-N build notes and spec section numbers must not reach
# the public repo. A worktree-isolated session cannot write outside the worktree, so the
# temptation is to drop them here instead -- do not. Copy them out with `cp` and leave nothing
# tracked behind.
Planning/
